Package: dde-dock-input-source
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dde-dock
Description: DDE dock monitor input source switcher
 Detect connected monitors and switch their hardware input sources using DDC/CI.
 Includes a dock plugin, an isolated helper, and a standalone debugging panel.
